  "gaps": "Postcodes, types and PANs from the Sept 2027 brochure (not GIAS-checked); Reach Academy Hanworth Park uses the trust's High Street, Feltham postcode. Faith/academy tables give allocations per criterion but usually no distance: where the last places went on a criterion with no distance the figure is not_published; where total allocations were below the places available (Blue School 2024-25, Rosary 2024, St Mary's Chiswick 2024, St Mary's Isleworth 2026, Reach Hanworth Park 2025) all_offered is INFERRED, not stated. St Lawrence 2024 recorded no_distance_offers (all places on Catholic CCP criteria). Nishkam has separate faith and open-place cut-offs; open value used. Lionel 2026 (2.647 miles) is printed in both 2026 tables but looks anomalous. 2024 values for St Michael & St Martin and St Paul's read from a rendered brochure page because the text layer overlapped. Individual academy/faith measuring methods not checked; walking assumed. Oak Hill Academy (TW13 4QP, PAN 120 in the 2027 brochure) appears in no allocation table and is excluded; junior schools (Norwood Green Junior, Strand-on-the-Green Junior) excluded.",
